cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it."
type: software
title: "Ferroptosis and drug resistance in colorectal cancer: Analysis code"
version: "1.0.0"
authors:
  - family-names: Zhou
    given-names: Jing
    affiliation: "First Clinical Medical College, Zhejiang Chinese Medical University"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/zhoujing687/ferroptosis-crc-analysis"
abstract: >-
  R analysis scripts for exploratory TCGA-COAD survival analyses, GSE42387
  transcriptomic analyses, and reconstruction of five aggregate bibliometric
  figure panels related to ferroptosis and colorectal cancer drug resistance.
  The MIT license applies to the original analysis code; included third-party
  data retain their source terms, as described in the README.
keywords:
  - ferroptosis
  - colorectal cancer
  - drug resistance
  - bibliometrics
  - transcriptomics
